      "frameId": "frame_2",
      "text": "A doubt that looking cannot settle becomes a\nquestion to you. Risky steps ask for your consent\nfirst, default No. The factory only touches issues\nlabelled for it, with at most three attempts.",
      "originalText": "A doubt that looking cannot settle becomes a\nquestion to you. Risky steps ask for your consent\nfirst, default No. The factory only touches issues\nlabelled for it, with at most three attempts.",
